### ko の訳(common)。英語の locales/en/common.ftl と同じ ID で訳を足す。無い ID は英語で出る。
### Translations for ko (common). Add entries with the same IDs as locales/en/common.ftl; missing IDs fall back to English.

# common-named-parameter-syntax = Enter one name and expression as name=expression.
# common-named-parameter-invalid-name = “{ $name }” cannot be used as a parameter name.
# common-named-parameter-duplicate = Parameter “{ $name }” already exists. Enter just { $name } to use it.
# common-named-parameter-duplicate-dimension = Dimension name “{ $name }” already exists. Enter just { $name } to use it.
# common-named-parameter-expression = Cannot evaluate { $expr }: { $reason }
# common-named-parameter-length = An angle was entered in a length field.
# common-named-parameter-angle = A length was entered in an angle field.

# common-open-dwg = DWG files cannot be read. Export the file as DXF or STEP in the original application, then open the exported file.
# common-open-dwg-version = Version marker: { $version }
